{"unit_id":"HaoyanZhang123__dsh-plugin-control-your-capture#card-zh","repo":"HaoyanZhang123/dsh-plugin-control-your-capture","commit":"c2f31c56993b8e99e98586d7968957e30c81e0c9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Control Your Capture 为 DSH 提供桌面截图与录屏工具，接入 capture_screenshot、capture_probe 和 capture_recording。可按物理像素捕获显示器、窗口或区域，将截图保存为 PNG 并把图像交给模型；还可诊断平台、显示器和后端能力，并在 Windows 单屏控制台录制显示器或区域为 MP4。适合需要让 agent 查看桌面细节或记录操作过程的场景。录屏需安装 FFmpeg（ddagrab、libx264）和 FFprobe。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:263-285","lib/tool.js:206-218","lib/recording-service.js:143-168"]}
