{"unit_id":"HaoyanZhang123__dsh-plugin-control-your-capture#feature-1","repo":"HaoyanZhang123/dsh-plugin-control-your-capture","commit":"c2f31c56993b8e99e98586d7968957e30c81e0c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Control Your Capture 的功能「capture_screenshot」：可截取显示器、窗口或物理像素区域，保存 PNG 并返回模型可查看的图像；maxWidth 仅缩小图片。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tool.js:206-213","lib/index.js:272-285"]}
{"unit_id":"HaoyanZhang123__dsh-plugin-control-your-capture#feature-2","repo":"HaoyanZhang123/dsh-plugin-control-your-capture","commit":"c2f31c56993b8e99e98586d7968957e30c81e0c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Control Your Capture 的功能「capture_probe」：调用 capture_probe 可查看平台、显示器物理尺寸、可用后端、权限、输出目录状态和各采集目标支持级别，不会生成截图。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tool.js:215-218","lib/service.js:949-970"]}
{"unit_id":"HaoyanZhang123__dsh-plugin-control-your-capture#feature-3","repo":"HaoyanZhang123/dsh-plugin-control-your-capture","commit":"c2f31c56993b8e99e98586d7968957e30c81e0c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Control Your Capture 的功能「capture_recording」：在支持的 Windows 单屏控制台录制显示器或区域；可开始、查询、停止或取消，停止后校验 MP4。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/recording-tool.js:191-207","lib/recording/windows.js:284-398"]}
{"unit_id":"HaoyanZhang123__dsh-plugin-control-your-capture#feature-4","repo":"HaoyanZhang123/dsh-plugin-control-your-capture","commit":"c2f31c56993b8e99e98586d7968957e30c81e0c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Control Your Capture 的功能「capture-sharp-skill」：插件挂载时会把 capture-sharp 指引技能安装到技能目录，帮助 agent 使用截图和录屏工具；可通过配置关闭安装。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:287-304","lib/provision-skill.js:35-56"]}
